Backport Caddy's idle-timeout override API from:
https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy/commit/f355b8687d5582ea9fcc99f71598109d1e5b6ced

The reader rearm check uses v2.11.7's deadlineSet flag in place of upstream's
armed == deadlineIdle. Other development-branch timeout changes are not included.
Forwardproxy uses a 24-hour idle timeout; no disable semantics are added.
The override stays in place for the lifetime of each authenticated CONNECT request.

